                <mxCell id="sc-note-success" value="Success / compliance states (Definition 4.1):&#10;F_C = { (m,s) in S_C | for all q in Qual(GM): m(q) = top }.&#10;Rule (1): map(n)=e =/= eps -&gt; istar fires via propagation.&#10;Rule (2): map(n)=eps -&gt; istar unchanged (silent transition)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
